{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2>Debug Quest is an exciting game with casual graphics that everyone can enjoy.<br>In order to heal the virus-infected game world, you became a vaccine to go on an adventure.<br>Set up numerous blocks, manipulate characters, go on an adventure, and find the source of the virus.<br>Please heal the game world by debugging!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><strong>Install blocks to make a road!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/cfbc69204d502e4e995bc5fbee4130c0.poster.avif?t=1686581546\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/cfbc69204d502e4e995bc5fbee4130c0.webm?t=1686581546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/cfbc69204d502e4e995bc5fbee4130c0.mp4?t=1686581546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You have to make a road using various blocks.<br>Certain blocks have special powers, so use them in the right place.<br><br><br><strong>Use your items well!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/aad5bd22f78531e75ebb2231eaf3be14.poster.avif?t=1686581546\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/aad5bd22f78531e75ebb2231eaf3be14.webm?t=1686581546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/aad5bd22f78531e75ebb2231eaf3be14.mp4?t=1686581546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Items have various effects.<br>You can activate the effect by equipping the item to the slot and pressing the use key.<br>Use various effects to make your way and defeat the boss to adventure.<br><br><br><strong> Try installing the plugin!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/4f9adb69f31532825850a074735ff50b.poster.avif?t=1686581546\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/4f9adb69f31532825850a074735ff50b.webm?t=1686581546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/4f9adb69f31532825850a074735ff50b.mp4?t=1686581546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The plugin cannot be installed infinitely.<br>Equip the plugin by rotating it on the plugin map and take effect.<br>The power of the plugin lasts forever.<br><br><br><strong>Face the unknown!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/243496eacd05fe86ae20b8ad292e33f3.poster.avif?t=1686581546\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/243496eacd05fe86ae20b8ad292e33f3.webm?t=1686581546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/243496eacd05fe86ae20b8ad292e33f3.mp4?t=1686581546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You will encounter an unknown situation. You can be rewarded or harmed by making the right choices.<br>Choose carefully!<br><br><br><strong>Cure the boss!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/83e1148e5556c5716f2287992282f87d.poster.avif?t=1686581546\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/83e1148e5556c5716f2287992282f87d.webm?t=1686581546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/83e1148e5556c5716f2287992282f87d.mp4?t=1686581546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>When you reach the end of the chapter, the boss will appear.<br>When you acquire a cure item that spawns on the map, a syringe that heals the boss flies.<br>If you hit enough syringes on the boss, the boss will be cured and you'll advance to the next chapter.<br><br><br><strong>Adventure with unique characters!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/ea991b8a69cef548aa5b83fe9cf8497f.poster.avif?t=1686581546\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/ea991b8a69cef548aa5b83fe9cf8497f.webm?t=1686581546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/ea991b8a69cef548aa5b83fe9cf8497f.mp4?t=1686581546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Many characters have different personalities<br>I have it. Go on a fun adventure using your character's abilities!<br><br><br><strong>Change the look of your character!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/41799fb8653e5a600c48e39c4576a929.poster.avif?t=1686581546\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441610/extras/41799fb8653e5a600c48e39c4576a929.webm?t=1686581546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_